    "media:imagetext": "Fins Class Menus\nLibationso\nSherry\nDubonnet Campari\nManhattan\nGin Martini Vodka Martini\nVermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins\nVodka Collins Daiquiri\nScotch Bourbon\nCanadian\nGin\nVodka Rum Premium Beer\nCoffee\nDelectationso\nCaribe Fruit Medley\nSliced ripe papaya and lush honey dew melon with Emperor grapes and Florida lime\nEggs Diable\nFresh poached eggs nestled in ripe tomato halves with a\ntouch of spice and a bubbling brown topping of aged Cheddar cheese\nServed with Becky potatoes and grilled crisp bacon\nGolden Duo\nA delicate Blini filled with cottage cheese accompanied by\nbuttery pound cake, French toasted golden rich\nServed with tangy sweet strawberry sauce and thick sour cream\nBakery Fresh Croissant and Blueberry Danish\nCreamy butter and premium preserves\nTea\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nSelected Red and White Wines\nChampagne Brut\nDrambuie\nBénédictine\nCrème de Menthe\nCognac Napoléon Contreau\nKahlúa\nAmaretto di Saronno\nD.2156\n200080.020",
