    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Ri\nCIDADE MARAVILHOSA-RIO DE JANEIRO\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting the\nbeautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty permanent\ncollections in the USA and abroad\nRIO DE JANEIRO is the jewel of South America. Nowhere in the world is a city blessed with so much natural\nbeauty. Corcovado Mountain, crowned by the imposing statue of Christ the Redeemer, and Sugar Loaf,\noverlooking Guanabara Bay and the city lights below, are equally breathtaking sights. Rio is also\nrenowned for its magnificent beaches. Gavea Beach, the site of the luxurious Inter-Continental.\nRio, and Copacabana Beach, with its mosaic walks, are world famous. Pan Am serves Rio daily from\nNew York, Washington, Miami, San Francisco, Los Angeles, and Houston\nAM.",
      "Fins Class Menus\nLibationso\nSherry\nDubonnet Campari\nManhattan\nGin Martini Vodka Martini\nVermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins\nVodka Collins Daiquiri\nScotch Bourbon\nCanadian\nGin\nVodka Rum Premium Beer\nCoffee\nDelectationso\nCaribe Fruit Medley\nSliced ripe papaya and lush honey dew melon with Emperor grapes and Florida lime\nEggs Diable\nFresh poached eggs nestled in ripe tomato halves with a\ntouch of spice and a bubbling brown topping of aged Cheddar cheese\nServed with Becky potatoes and grilled crisp bacon\nGolden Duo\nA delicate Blini filled with cottage cheese accompanied by\nbuttery pound cake, French toasted golden rich\nServed with tangy sweet strawberry sauce and thick sour cream\nBakery Fresh Croissant and Blueberry Danish\nCreamy butter and premium preserves\nTea\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nSelected Red and White Wines\nChampagne Brut\nDrambuie\nBénédictine\nCrème de Menthe\nCognac Napoléon Contreau\nKahlúa\nAmaretto di Saronno\nD.2156\n200080.020"
